From jones at reed.edu  Sat Jun 19 18:02:58 1999
From: jones at reed.edu (Albyn Jones)
Date: Sat, 19 Jun 1999 11:02:58 -0700
Subject: Re: [S] Introductory level Stat courses based on S-PLUS.
In-Reply-To: <376A57A9.5B77BF6A@math.mun.ca>
